+    ///    the code the gates pin.
+    /// 2. `fill_bytes(off, len)` == the two's-complement byte image of
+    ///    `fill_fp` over the same range, at ranges that split blocks and
+    ///    rows and in the CHUNKED form (successive pieces that reassemble
